WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- The headlines say

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.500
that former-president Trump was exonerated

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.650
in violently clearing out
protestors for a photo op

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.860
at Lafayette Square last year.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.140
Those headlines are wrong.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.320
First of all, this report
was incredibly narrow.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.550
It looked only to the actions
of the U.S. Park Police.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.230
It didn't look to the Secret Service.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:16.450
It didn't interview Attorney
General William Barr.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.140
It didn't talk about all of
the Bureau of Prisons Officers

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.160
who were in Lafayette Square that day.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.910
And second of all, the facts
that are in this report are

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.590
actually incredibly damning if
you actually read the report.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.650
It does appear that the
U.S. Park Police had a plan

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.870
to clear protesters in
order to put up a fence.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.700
However, the U.S. Park Police had no idea

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.800
the president was going to be on site

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.120
until Bill Barr came out, informed them,

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.070
to which the Park Police was incredulous.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:37.903
Then minutes later,

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:39.640
before the Park Police could
even implement their plan

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.240
to give warnings to the protestors,

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.010
the U.S. Secret Service jumped the gun

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:45.432
and started violently attacking
the protestors on site,

00:00:45.432 --> 00:00:47.810
and on top of that, the U.S.
Park Police were not authorized

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.310
to use CS gas and pepper balls,

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.460
which the Secret Service

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.570
and the Bureau of Prisons
employees were actually using.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:54.680
There is much more to the story,

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.160
and this is not an exoneration.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.760
This still appears to be
exactly what it looks like.

